{"ID":"20240118151420-94nbv5j","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240118151420-94nbv5j","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151420-94nbv5j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151420-qnd54lg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119141724-l2gjaxj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119141703-05kj5yl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:58,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:58\u0026#125;","title":"018扁青","type":"doc","updated":"20240125105208"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151420-qnd54lg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151420-qnd54lg","updated":"20240119141647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘平，主目痛明目，折跌痈肿，金创不疗，破积聚解毒气，利精神，久服轻身不老。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119141652-udru2de","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119141652-udru2de"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"神农雷公小寒无毒，治丈夫内绝令人有子。去寒热风痹，及丈夫茎中百病益精。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119141656-f4ha5vu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119141656-f4ha5vu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】吐风痰，癫痫，平肝。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119141658-2hrz4c6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119141658-2hrz4c6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】养肝明目。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119141647-pitgshm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119141647-pitgshm"}},{"ID":"20240119141703-8229o9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119141703-8229o9k","updated":"20240125105130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"扁青，治症非常多，我们空青、曾青很多都是治疗眼科的病，诸位看到没有，都是眼科的疾病，目痛、目瞑都是在这个白青、扁青上面。"}]},{"ID":"20240119141703-89mra3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119141703-89mra3t","updated":"20240125105153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"养肝明目，我们一般最常用的眼科的药都是曾青，空青，扁青，白青，都是从这里面出来的，金石类的药很多，当然我们草木类的要也有，像贝母，我们用在眼科上面非常好。我们甚至于贝母都可以泡水，我们会介绍，这里不讲，等讲到贝母再说。"}]},{"ID":"20240119141703-05kj5yl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119141703-05kj5yl","updated":"20240125105208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"象金石类的药，如果炮制过，提炼过以后，你放水下去，然后无论是提炼还是锻过，烧过烧红，打碎磨的很细，然后让它溶解到水里面让它飘，就是水飞，停在那边，然后沉底，沉底的不要，溶化在水里面的就可以作眼科的药来涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240119141724-l2gjaxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119141724-l2gjaxj","updated":"20240119141725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"像曾青、白青、扁青都可以作眼科的药水来涂，眼睛痛痒都可以止痛。象我前面讲的，我们用炉甘石都可以。"}]}]}